# Line endings are preserved exactly as the artefacts were produced, not normalised.
#
# src/train_lpr.py and src/train_modern.py were CRLF files on the machine that ran the
# experiments, and docs/PROVENANCE.md quotes the md5 of that byte stream (ffd33fc7...).
# Letting git rewrite them to LF would change the checksum of the file behind every
# reported number, which is exactly the link this release exists to make checkable.
* -text

*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
